# Concept Doc Planning

- Keep each concept file focused on one system block.
- Prefer short, human-readable names and headings.
- Use concise sections (`Scope`, `Covers`, `Source docs`) unless more detail is explicitly requested.
- Point to `docs/specs/` for invariants and `docs/archive/` for history.
- Avoid sprint/task backlogs in concept docs.
